---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---

<Layout title="AI Automation Systems" description="We design and implement custom AI automations for recurring, process-heavy work.">

  <PageHero
    label="Services"
    title='Turn recurring work into <span class="text-ms-green-400">reliable AI systems.</span>'
    subtitle="Most companies already know where time gets lost. Weekly reports. Client follow-ups. Research summaries. Internal coordination. Document handling. We turn those workflows into dependable operating systems for your business."
  />

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        The problem is usually not a lack of ideas. It is the pile of recurring work that everyone knows is necessary, nobody enjoys doing, and no one has had the time to redesign.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white font-medium leading-relaxed">
        The Mindshift identifies the right use cases, designs the workflow, connects the required tools, and builds automations that fit the way your team already works.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        The result is not generic AI output. It is a practical system tailored to your processes, quality standards, and communication style.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-16">What we automate.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        {[
          {
            title: "Research & Summaries",
            desc: "Market scans, competitor monitoring, briefings, internal summaries, and other recurring knowledge work that currently disappears into scattered tabs and rushed notes."
          },
          {
            title: "Reporting & Follow-Ups",
            desc: "Weekly reports, client updates, meeting follow-ups, and recurring communication workflows that need consistency, speed, and the right context."
          },
          {
            title: "Document Handling",
            desc: "Classification, extraction, routing, drafting, and quality checks for documents that move through your business every day."
          },
          {
            title: "Internal Coordination",
            desc: "Operational workflows where information needs to move cleanly between people, tools, and decisions without constant manual handoffs."
          }
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="bg-ms-dark-800 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">{item.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12">What we deliver.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        {[
          "Workflow discovery to identify the highest-value automation opportunities",
          "Custom AI workflows built around your real processes",
          "Context and instruction design so outputs match your standards and voice",
          "Tool integrations for research, documents, email, internal knowledge, and communications",
          "Testing, refinement, and rollout with your team",
          "Documentation and handover so the system remains usable and maintainable"
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-ms-green-400 mt-2.5 shrink-0"></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-300">{item}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-16">How we work.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        {[
          { num: "1", title: "Discover", desc: "We analyze where recurring work consumes time, where bottlenecks appear, and which workflows are best suited for automation." },
          { num: "2", title: "Design", desc: "We define the workflow, the required inputs and outputs, the decision points, and the quality controls needed for reliable execution." },
          { num: "3", title: "Build", desc: "We create the automation system, connect the necessary tools, and adapt the setup to your operating reality." },
          { num: "4", title: "Deploy", desc: "We test the system on real work, refine it with your team, and improve it until it produces dependable results." }
        ].map(step => (
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-ms-green-500/10 border border-ms-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-ms-green-400 font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              {step.num}
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">{step.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">{step.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12">Best fit.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        {[
          "Teams losing hours every week to recurring operational tasks",
          "Organizations that want practical AI implementation, not another strategy deck",
          "Businesses that need tailored workflows rather than off-the-shelf tooling",
          "Leadership teams that care about speed, quality, and integration into existing operations"
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="bg-ms-dark-700 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8">
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">{item}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12">Principles.</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-8">
        <li>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Built around workflows, not demos.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">We start with the work your team actually does, not with a flashy model demo looking for a problem.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Technology-agnostic.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">We use whatever works. OpenAI, Anthropic, open source, or a combination. The model is a detail, not a religion.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Built to transfer.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">We do not create dependencies for their own sake. Your team should be able to operate, maintain, and extend what we build.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Quality still matters.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">The sweet spot is work that is repetitive enough to standardize, valuable enough to justify investment, and important enough that oversight still matters.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">What changes.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        Typical outcomes include faster turnaround times, fewer manual handoffs, more consistent output, and measurable time savings across teams.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white font-medium leading-relaxed">
        If your team is spending too much time on repeatable work, we can identify where AI automation will create the most value and build the right system with you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA
    headline='Too much repeatable work, not enough leverage?'
    sub="Start with a discovery call. We will identify where AI automation can create real value in your workflow and whether this is the right entry point for your business."
    buttonText="Discuss Your Workflow"
  />

</Layout>
